 "text": "NileTech Solutions — company overview (synthetic fixture) · Page 1\nAbout NileTech Solutions\nNileTech Solutions operates from Cairo, Alexandria, Dubai.\nServices\n• Business Process Automation — Replace manual back-office steps with governed\nworkflows.\n• Custom Software Engineering — Build and maintain line-of-business systems end to end.\n• Data Platform Engineering — Consolidate scattered data into a governed analytics layer.\n• Systems Integration — Connect existing systems without replacing them.\n• Cloud Migration — Move workloads with a documented rollback path at every stage.\n• Managed Support — Ongoing operation and improvement of delivered systems.\nContact\nGeneral enquiries: hello@niletech.example\nHow we deliver\nThis section is synthetic text written for the parser benchmark.\nEvery engagement starts with a short discovery phase. The team maps the current\nprocess, lists the systems it touches and agrees with the client which steps must never\nchange.\nWork is delivered in two-week increments. Each increment ends with a demonstration on\nthe client's own data and a written note of what changed, what was tested and what is still\nopen.\n1. Discovery: map the process, the systems and the owners.\n2. Design: agree the target workflow and its controls.\n3. Build: deliver in increments with tests on real data.\n4. Handover: train operators and document the runbook.\n",
